    doctorResponsePositive: "Of course! Let\u2019s go over your symptoms carefully."
    patientReactionPositive: Okay, so I'm going through some [symptoms].
    doctorResponseNegative: "Feeling \u2018off\u2019 isn\u2019t very specific. Can
      you be clearer?"
    patientReactionNegative: That's not very nice of you but okay, I've been feeling
      a bit of [symptoms].
  - doctorQuestion: 'Hello [name], so I take it that you''re currently experiencing
      [symptoms], correct? Are you feeling anything else?  '
    patientReply: "I hope I\u2019m not taking too much of your time. "
    doctorResponsePositive: "Not at all! I\u2019m here to help you feel better. What
      else could be the problem?"
    patientReactionPositive: I have also been dealing with [symptoms] the past few
      days.
    doctorResponseNegative: "Well, I do have other patients, so let\u2019s not waste
      time."
    patientReactionNegative: Alright, I've been feeing a bit of [symptoms].
  - doctorQuestion: 'Hello [name], so I take it that you''re currently experiencing
      [symptoms], correct? Are you feeling anything else?  '
    patientReply: 'I really appreciate you helping me with this. '
    doctorResponsePositive: "No problem at all. Let\u2019s get you taken care of"
    patientReactionPositive: Well, I've been feeling a bit of [symptoms].
    doctorResponseNegative: "If you appreciate it, don\u2019t ask too many questions."
    patientReactionNegative: Oh... Alright. I've been feeling [symptoms].
  - doctorQuestion: 'Hello [name], so I take it that you''re currently experiencing
      [symptoms], correct? Are you feeling anything else?  '
    patientReply: 'I just want to make sure I understand everything properly. '
    doctorResponsePositive: "Your concerns matter. Let\u2019s go through this together"
    patientReactionPositive: "That\u2019s very kind of you. It means a lot. I'm also
      experiencing [symptoms]."
    doctorResponseNegative: "I\u2019m listening, but let\u2019s get to the point."
    patientReactionNegative: "Oh\u2026 I\u2019ll try to be quicker, then. I experience
      [symptoms]."
